# project: 1:1\(ish\) 3D printed replica of Chuck e. Cheese animatronics
<br>
<br>
<br>
I started working on this project at the end of June of 2025.
My goal is to recreate an entire set of Chuck e. Cheese animatronic bots with a 3D printer.
I got the files from [this](https://www.reddit.com/r/Animatronics/comments/1lu6l2c/comment/n23s9yl/?context=3) Reddit post.
I had originally started this project a few years back when the [original](https://www.reddit.com/r/Animatronics/comments/18neflf/3d_printed_cyberamic_mech/) files came out, but due to some complications, I was unable to complete it.
While those files have been a massive help, they unfortunately only work for Chuck e. Cheese and Helen. Thus, I started modifying them to work with some of the other characters.

This project is far from complete, so I only have a few unfinished files to give you. For now, I'll leave a .zip file containing all of the files I've modified.
Please note that these files are far from finished, and still have plenty of work to be done on them.
<br>

[File download.](https://archive.syntropicinteractive.com/pizzafiles/3dmodels/Cyberamic%20Parts/pizzaparts/)

